      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would be a real game changer for me. This is the one feature that would really lift immersion to the next level. In my opinion VRChat needs to seriously consider this before a competitor does. I do get, though, that not everyone will prefer this, so it should be toggleable just like the current avatar interactions, also possibly for performance sake. But nonetheless, this is huge! And a lot of people would love this! I can't believe this canny has already been posted 3 years ago. So I wanna bump this!",
